A patch on upstream Mermaid at the pin, for the reference ferrigura is checked against
(docs-port/ORACLE-PLAN.md). Applied in the order of the file names by tools/reference/setup.sh.

feat(elk): a capture hook for ferrigura's harness

A page callback, globalThis.__mermaidElkCapture, receives each ELK input and its layout, so the harness compares ferrigura's ELK graphs with the reference's. It does nothing when no callback is installed. As in the fork (00f87f4ee).

